            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82502,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listelerde depoladığımız verileri incelemek için genellikle uç değerleri, yani minimum ve maksimum değerleri bulmak yararlıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"light_intensity = [\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Maximum",
            "id": 82503,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>scores</code> gibi bir veri listesindeki en büyük sayıyı bulmak için, parantezlerin arasına listenin adını yazarak <code>max()</code> fonksiyonunu kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max(scores))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>max</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listedeki en büyük sayıyı bulmak için parantezler arasında listenin adıyla <code>max()</code> kullan.</p><p><code>scores</code> listesinde dört sayı var. Kodun en büyük sayı olan <code>12</code> değerini yazdırmasını sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max(scores))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;scores&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>max</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>scores</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Minimum",
            "id": 82504,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>scores</code> listesindeki en küçük sayıyı bulmak için parantezlerin arasına liste adı gelecek şekilde <code>min()</code> fonksiyonunu kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(scores))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>min</code>, ardından <code>scores</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in variable",
            "id": 82505,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>min()</code> ve <code>max()</code> sonuçlarını değişkenlere kaydederek yeniden kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"min_score = min(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max_score = max(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max_score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min_score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>min(scores)</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>max(scores)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En küçük puanı <code>min_score</code>, en büyük puanı da <code>max_score</code> değişkenine kaydet. Ardından önce en büyüğünü yazdır. Böylece çıktı önce <code>12</code>, sonra <code>1</code> olsun.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"min_score = min(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max_score = max(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max_score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min_score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>min(scores)</code>, ardından <code>max(scores)</code>, <code>max_score</code> ve son olarak <code>min_score</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
