            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>max(jeans_sizes)</code> sonucunu bir değişkene kaydederek bu değeri yeniden kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Son satırın yerine hangi satır yazılırsa sonuç <code>largest_size</code> değişkenine kaydedilir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"jeans_sizes = [\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"28\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max(jeans_sizes)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>largest_size = max(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>largest_size == max(jeans_sizes)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>largest_size = jeans_sizes</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>largest_size = max(jeans_sizes)</code>.</p></body></html>",
